   "status": "added",
   "additions": 5,
   "deletions": 0,
   "patch": "@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@\n+---\n+'evlog': patch\n+---\n+\n+Widen the optional `nitro` peer range so that `nitro@3.0.261103-rc` and stable Nitro 3 releases such as `nitro@3.0.0` install without a peer conflict. Before, npm failed with ERESOLVE and pnpm printed a peer warning when a project used either with evlog 2.x."
  },
